[2026-06-02 00:00:18] [INFO] [PreToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"0308add7-d971-472c-861f-deb0bb083642","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\0308add7-d971-472c-861f-deb0bb083642.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\claude_tap_plus","permission_mode":"auto","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\plans\\validated-giggling-volcano.md","content":"# Plan: GET/PUT /api/config — 系统配置管理\n\n## Context\n\nBDD-TDD-009 要求实现 `GET/PUT /api/config` 端点，用于管理系统运行时配置（log_level、session_timeout、max_concurrent、auto_claim、default_model）。配置持久化到 SQLite `config` 表。\n\n## 修改文件清单\n\n### 新建文件（3 个）\n\n1. **`claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/store/config_store.go`** — ConfigStore 接口 + SQLite 实现\n2. **`claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/service/config_service.go`** — ConfigService\n3. **`claude_tap_plus/tests/backend/config_api_test.go`** — 测试\n\n### 修改文件（6 个）\n\n4. **`claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/store/migrations.go`** — 加 config 表 DDL\n5. **`claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/store/sqlite.go`** — SQLiteStore 加 configStore + Configs() 方法\n6. **`claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/store/store.go`** — 加 ConfigStore 接口 + Store 聚合\n7. **`claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/api/response.go`** — 加 ConfigResponse\n8. **`claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/api/router.go`** — Handlers 加 Config + 路由分发\n9. **`claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/server.go`** — 创建 ConfigService + 注入\n\n## 实现步骤\n\n### Step 1: migration 加 config 表\n\n`migrations.go` — stmts 数组末尾追加：\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS config (\n    key       TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n    value     TEXT NOT NULL,\n    updated_at DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP\n)\n```\n\n### Step 2: Store 层\n\n**`store.go`** — 加接口：\n\n```go\ntype ConfigStore interface {\n    GetConfig(ctx context.Context) (map[string]interface{}, error)\n    UpdateConfig(ctx context.Context, updates map[string]interface{}) error\n}\n```\n\nStore 聚合接口加 `Configs() ConfigStore`。\n\n**`config_store.go`** — SQLite 实现：\n- `sqliteConfigStore` struct `{ db *sql.DB }`\n- 默认值 map（log_level=info, session_timeout=3600, max_concurrent=10, auto_claim=true, default_model=claude-3-opus）\n- `InitDefaults(ctx)` — 启动时插入缺失的默认配置\n- `GetConfig(ctx)` — SELECT 所有 key/value，JSON 反序列化 value\n- `UpdateConfig(ctx, updates)` — 事务内 UPSERT，含 key 验证和 value 验证\n- `isValidConfigKey(key)`, `validateConfigValue(key, value)` 私有校验函数\n\n**`sqlite.go`** — NewSQLiteStore 中创建 configStore 并调用 InitDefaults，加 `Configs() ConfigStore` 方法。\n\n### Step 3: Service 层\n\n**`service/config_service.go`** — 简单转发：\n\n```go\ntype ConfigService struct { store store.ConfigStore }\nfunc NewConfigService(s store.ConfigStore) *ConfigService\nfunc (svc *ConfigService) Get(ctx) (map[string]interface{}, error)\nfunc (svc *ConfigService) Update(ctx, updates map[string]interface{}) error\n```\n\n### Step 4: API 层\n\n**`response.go`** — 加：\n\n```go\ntype ConfigResponse struct {\n    Config map[string]interface{} `json:\"config\"`\n}\n```\n\n**`router.go`** — Handlers 加 `Config *ConfigHandler`，路由用单 handler 分发 GET/PUT：\n\n```go\nmux.HandleFunc(\"/api/config\", func(w, r) {\n    switch r.Method {\n    case http.MethodGet:  h.Config.Get(w, r)\n    case http.MethodPut:  h.Config.Update(w, r)\n    default: writeError(w, 405, \"method_not_allowed\", \"use GET or PUT\")\n    }\n})\n```\n\n### Step 5: Server 接线\n\n`server.go` — Start() 中创建 configSvc，注入 Handlers。\n\n### Step 6: 测试\n\n`config_api_test.go` — 遵循 issue_api_test.go 的 testEnv 模式：\n\n1. `TestConfig_GetDefaults` — GET 返回 5 个默认配置项\n2. `TestConfig_UpdateSingleField` — PUT 更新 log_level → debug\n3. `TestConfig_UpdateMultipleFields` — 同时更新 2 个字段\n4. `TestConfig_InvalidValue` — session_timeout=-1 → 400\n5. `TestConfig_UnknownKey` — unknown_key → 400\n6. `TestConfig_MethodNotAllowed` — POST → 405\n7. `TestConfig_UpdatePreservesOthers` — 更新不影响其他配置项\n\n## 验证\n\n```bash\ncd claude_tap_plus\ngo build ./...                                         # 编译\ngo test ./tests/backend/config_api_test.go -v          # 新测试\ngo test ./tests/backend/...                            # 回归\ngo test ./tests/integration/...                        # 回归\n```\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_cf94e37cd6e64af3bd63ba95"}
