kend/...                            # 回归\ngo test ./tests/integration/...                        # 回归\n```\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":127,"newStart":1,"newLines":118,"lines":["-# Plan: GET /api/logs — 系统日志查询接口","+# Plan: GET/PUT /api/config — 系统配置管理"," "," ## Context"," ","-BDD-TDD-008 文档要求实现 `GET /api/logs` 端点，用于查询后端服务的运行日志。后端服务使用 `internal/logger/logger.go` 写日志，日志文件存放在 `{logDir}/YYYY-MM-DD.log`，格式为：","+BDD-TDD-009 要求实现 `GET/PUT /api/config` 端点，用于管理系统运行时配置（log_level、session_timeout、max_concurrent、auto_claim、default_model）。配置持久化到 SQLite `config` 表。"," ","-```","-20:56:28.000 [INFO ] backend.cmd: backend starting: host=127.0.0.1 port=8080","-```","-","-**注意**：BDD 文档中的正则假设格式为 `[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS] [LEVEL] [source] message`，但实际 logger.go 格式为 `HH:MM:SS.mmm [LEVEL] module: message`（日期在文件名中，不在行内）。实现时按实际格式调整正则。","-"," ## 修改文件清单"," ","-### 新建文件（2 个）","+### 新建文件（3 个）"," ","-1. **`claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/api/log_handler.go`** — LogHandler","-2. **`claude_tap_plus/tests/backend/log_api_test.go`** — 测试","+1. **`claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/store/config_store.go`** — ConfigStore 接口 + SQLite 实现","+2. **`claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/service/config_service.go`** — ConfigService","+3. **`claude_tap_plus/tests/backend/config_api_test.go`** — 测试"," ","-### 修改文件（5 个）","+### 修改文件（6 个）"," ","-3. **`claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/api/response.go`** — 添加 LogsResponse、LogItem","-4. **`claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/api/router.go`** — Handlers 加 Log 字段 + 注册路由","-5. **`claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/server.go`** — 创建 LogService + 传入 handler","-6. **`claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/config.go`** — Config 加 LogDir 字段","-7. **`claude_tap_plus/cmd/claude-tap/backend_cmd.go`** — 设置 cfg.LogDir","+4. **`claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/store/migrations.go`** — 加 config 表 DDL","+5. **`claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/store/sqlite.go`** — SQLiteStore 加 configStore + Configs() 方法","+6. **`claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/store/store.go`** — 加 ConfigStore 接口 +