[2026-06-02 00:00:36] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"80496be2-d6f0-44b7-9580-676cd87c6c20","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\80496be2-d6f0-44b7-9580-676cd87c6c20.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"plan","agent_id":"ad06a5aa81dcbf991","agent_type":"Explore","hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\.claude\\skills\\001-testcode-python\\SKILL.md"},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\.claude\\skills\\001-testcode-python\\SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: 001-testcode-python\ndescription: 在 doc/testcode/python 目录下编写和管理 Python 测试脚本、API 自动化测试及其他脚本\nuser-invocable: true\nallowed-tools:\n  - Bash\n  - Read\n  - Write\n  - Edit\n  - Glob\n  - Grep\n---\n\n# Testcode Python Skill\n\n在 `$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/doc/testcode/python/` 下编写和管理 Python 脚本。\n\n## 目录规范\n\n```\ndoc/testcode/python/\n├── api/            # API 自动化测试\n└── other/          # 其他脚本（测试、提示词、工具等）\n```\n\n## 规则\n\n1. 所有脚本放到对应子目录，不在根目录散落文件\n2. 每个脚本文件开头写明用途（一行注释）\n3. API 测试脚本使用 `requests` 库，基础配置从环境变量或 `.env` 读取\n4. 优先用标准库，需要第三方库时先在脚本顶部 `import` 前用注释标注依赖\n5. 测试脚本命名：`test_<name>.py`，工具脚本命名：`<name>.py`\n\n## 操作指引\n\n- API 测试 → `doc/testcode/python/api/test_<name>.py`\n- 其他脚本 → `doc/testcode/python/other/<name>.py`\n","numLines":38,"startLine":1,"totalLines":38}},"tool_use_id":"call_4effc3eabbf941a3a46f0960","duration_ms":1}
