[2026-06-02 00:00:37] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"80496be2-d6f0-44b7-9580-676cd87c6c20","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\80496be2-d6f0-44b7-9580-676cd87c6c20.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"plan","agent_id":"a2a63f3f3c9f269cc","agent_type":"Explore","hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\.claude\\skills\\003-7-issue-pr\\SKILL.md"},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\.claude\\skills\\003-7-issue-pr\\SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: 003-7-issue-pr\ndescription: 创建 PR 关联 issue\nuser-invocable: true\nallowed-tools:\n  - Bash\n  - Read\n  - Edit\n  - Write\n  - Glob\n  - Grep\n---\n\n# Issue PR Skill\n\n创建 PR 并关联 issue。\n\n## 操作流程\n\n1. 用户输入 `/003-7-issue-pr #N`\n2. 确认当前在解决分支上\n3. **验证 PR body 必须包含 `## Test plan` 区块**\n   - Test Plan 中每一项必须是可勾选的 checkbox：`- [ ] 测试项描述`\n   - 如果缺少 Test Plan 区块或格式不对，拒绝创建并提示补充\n4. `git push -u origin <branch>`\n5. `gh pr create`，body 中包含 `Closes #N` 自动关联 issue\n6. 输出 PR 编号和链接\n\n## PR 格式\n\n```\ntitle: <type>: <简短描述>\nbody:\n  ## Summary\n  - 变更点1\n  - 变更点2\n\n  ## Test plan\n  - [ ] 测试项1\n  - [ ] 测试项2\n\n  Closes #<N>\n```\n\n**Test Plan 格式要求：**\n- 必须包含 `## Test plan` 标题（不区分大小写）\n- 每项以 `- [ ]` 开头，不可用其他格式\n- 提交 PR 时 Test Plan 为未勾选状态\n\n## 规则\n\n1. PR 必须通过 `Closes #N` 关联 issue\n2. PR body 必须包含 `## Test plan` 区块，否则拒绝创建\n3. 创建 PR 后提示执行 `/003-8-issue-test #N` 执行测试\n\n## gh 命令参考\n\n```bash\n# 创建 PR\ngh pr create --title \"<title>\" --body \"<body>\"\n\n# 查看当前分支的 PR\ngh pr list --head <branch> --json number,title,state\n\n# 更新 PR body\ngh pr edit <PR编号> --body \"<更新后的body>\"\n```\n","numLines":68,"startLine":1,"totalLines":68}},"tool_use_id":"call_06e311b27fd34f88aaf6772d","duration_ms":1}
