[2026-06-02 00:00:42] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"80496be2-d6f0-44b7-9580-676cd87c6c20","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\80496be2-d6f0-44b7-9580-676cd87c6c20.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"plan","agent_id":"a2a63f3f3c9f269cc","agent_type":"Explore","hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\.claude\\skills\\003-9-issue-review\\SKILL.md"},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\.claude\\skills\\003-9-issue-review\\SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: 003-9-issue-review\ndescription: 审核 PR：合并或打回\nuser-invocable: true\nallowed-tools:\n  - Bash\n  - Read\n---\n\n# Issue Review Skill\n\n审核 PR，执行合并或打回操作。\n\n## 操作流程\n\n### 合并（merge）\n\n1. 用户输入 `/003-9-issue-review merge #N`\n2. 找到关联 issue #N 的 PR\n3. **强制检查 Test Plan 完成度**：\n   ```bash\n   # 拉取 PR body\n   gh pr view <PR编号> --json body --jq '.body'\n   # 解析 ## Test plan 区块，检查是否还存在未勾选的 - [ ]\n   ```\n4. **如果存在未勾选的 `- [ ]`**：\n   - 阻止合并\n   - 列出所有未完成项\n   - 提示先执行 `/003-8-issue-test #N` 完成测试\n5. **如果全部 `[x]`**：\n   - 执行 `gh pr merge <PR> --merge`\n   - 删除远程分支\n   - 输出合并结果\n\n### 打回（reject）\n\n1. 用户输入 `/003-9-issue-review reject #N`\n2. `gh pr comment <PR> --body \"打回原因：xxx\"`\n3. `gh issue edit <N> --remove-label \"in-progress\" --add-label \"rejected\"`\n4. `gh issue reopen <N>`（如已关闭）\n5. 后续重新走 claim → fix → done → pr → test → review 流程\n\n## 规则\n\n1. **Test Plan 中存在未勾选的 `- [ ]` 时，禁止执行合并**\n2. 打回必须写明原因\n3. 打回后 issue 标记 `rejected`，重新领取时清除\n\n## gh 命令参考\n\n```bash\n# 找到关联 issue 的 PR\ngh pr list --state open --json number,body --jq \".[] | select(.body | test(\\\"Closes #$ISSUE_NUM\\\"))\"\n\n# 合并（仅在 Test Plan 全部 [x] 时）\ngh pr merge <PR编号> --merge\n\n# 打回\ngh pr comment <PR编号> --body \"打回原因\"\ngh issue edit <N> --remove-label \"in-progress\" --add-label \"rejected\"\ngh issue reopen <N>\n```\n","numLines":63,"startLine":1,"totalLines":63}},"tool_use_id":"call_a8b1040f27e941dc97669ed0","duration_ms":2}
