code-python\n005-git-commit      → 999-1-git-commit\n004-git-push        → 999-2-git-push\n```\n\n### Phase 2: registry.conf 更新（2 个文件）\n\n文件：`.claude/skills/registry.conf` 和 `.codex/skills/registry.conf`\n\n替换为新编号，按系列排序：\n```\n001-1-issue-init\n001-2-issue\n001-3-issue-discuss\n001-4-issue-claim\n001-5-issue-fix\n001-6-issue-done\n001-7-issue-pr\n001-8-issue-test\n001-9-issue-review\n002-1-doc\n002-2-doc-testcode-python\n999-1-git-commit\n999-2-git-push\n999-other-110-requirement-planning\n```\n\n### Phase 3: SKILL.md name 字段（28 个文件）\n\n每个技能目录的 `SKILL.md` 第二行 `name:` 字段更新为新编号。涉及 `.claude/skills/` 和 `.codex/skills/` 两套。\n\n### Phase 4: Shell 脚本 SKILL_TAG（~56 个文件）\n\n每个技能的 `init.sh`, `init_check.sh`, `03UserPromptSubmit.sh`, `16Stop.sh`（部分还有 `run.sh`）中的 `SKILL_TAG=` 值更新。\n\n**特殊：** `002-2-doc-testcode-python/scripts/run.sh` 中 `SKILL_TAG=\"001-testcode-python:run\"` → `SKILL_TAG=\"002-2-doc-testcode-python:run\"`\n\n### Phase 5: 跨技能引用更新\n\n**001 系列内部链式引用（SKILL.md）：**\n\n| 文件 | 旧引用 | 新引用 |\n|------|--------|--------|\n| `001-6-issue-done/SKILL.md` | `/003-7-issue-pr` | `/001-7-issue-pr` |\n| `001-5-issue-fix/SKILL.md` | `/003-6-issue-done` | `/001-6-issue-done` |\n| `001-7-issue-pr/SKILL.md` | `/003-8-issue-test` | `/001-8-issue-test` |\n| `001-8-issue-test/SKILL.md` | `/003-9-issue-review` | `/001-9-issue-review` |\n| `001-9-issue-review/SKILL.md` | `/003-8-issue-test` | `/001-8-issue-test` |\n| `001-1-issue-init/SKILL.md` | `/003-1-issue-init` | `/001-1-issue-init` |\n| `001-2-issue/SKILL.md` | `/003-2-issue` | `/001-2-issue` |\n| ... 所有 SKILL.md 中 `用户输入 /003-` | `/003-` | `/001-` |\n\n**Shell 脚本 echo 提示中的引用（~15 处）：**\n\n全部 `003-` 前缀 → `001-`，涉及文件：\n- `001-1-issue-init/scripts/init_check.sh` — `请运行 /003-1-issue-init`\n- `001-1-issue-init/scripts/init.sh` — 硬编码路径 `skills/003-1-issue-init/labels.conf`\n- `001-3-issue-discuss/scripts/03UserPromptSubmit.sh` — `/003-3-issue-discuss` (×2)\n- `001-4-issue-claim/scripts/03UserPromptSubmit.sh` — `/003-4-issue-claim` (×2)\n- `0